{"ref":"character:sonia-belmont","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ode to Castlevania)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Sonia Belmont is a playable character from the Ode to Castlevania DLC of Vampire Survivors. Her starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Sonic_Whip.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:sonic-whip"}," ",{"t":"Sonic Whip","r":"weapon:sonic-whip"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["31 October 2024 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Sonia"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["TP_SONIA"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["TP_Sonia_Character"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Sonic_Whip.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:sonic-whip"}," ",{"t":"Sonic Whip","r":"weapon:sonic-whip"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Find 7 Heart Refresh after opening the Stallion Gate."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Ode_to_Castlevania-Daniele_Zandara.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"Bloody Tears - Vampire Survivors\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+40%"]]},{"label":"Luck","cells":[["+10%"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The player can unlock this character by collecting a total of 7 ",{"i":"Sprite-Heart_Refresh.png","w":24,"h":24}," Heart Refresh items on the ",{"t":"Ode to Castlevania","r":"stage:ode-to-castlevania-stage"}," stage, which appear after collecting the ",{"i":"Sprite-Stallion_Gate.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:stallion-gate"}," ",{"t":"Stallion Gate","r":"relic:stallion-gate"}," relic, then purchasing with ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Sonia can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"legendmother\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Sonia starts with +40% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"}," and +10% ",{"i":"Sprite-Luck.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},". Every time she overheals by 8 health points or more, she triggers a ",{"i":"Sprite-Rapid_Fire.png","w":24,"h":18}," Rapid Fire, lasting for 10 seconds. This bonus can not be triggered more than every 5 seconds, but multiple instances of this bonus can be active at the same time."]},{"k":"p","c":["Sonia can find special Ode to Castlevania pickups from light sources."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Sonia synergizes with weapons such as ",{"i":"Sprite-Lifesign_Scan.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:lifesign-scan"}," ",{"t":"Lifesign Scan","r":"weapon:lifesign-scan"}," and its Evolution ",{"i":"Sprite-Paranormal_Scan.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"}," ",{"t":"Paranormal Scan","r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"},", which keep the ability nearly permanently active without the player needing to do anything. ",{"t":"Bloody Tear","r":"weapon:bloody-tear"}," and ",{"t":"Fuwalafuwaloo","r":"weapon:fuwalafuwaloo"}," also have a similar synergy, though rely on getting crits and as such aren't quite as powerful on her."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Sonia_Belmont.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Sonia Belmont's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Sonia_Belmont.gif","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["beta ",{"i":"Steam_logo.svg","w":16,"h":16,"a":"Steam"}," 1 April 2026 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fixed Sonia not unlocking"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 31 October 2024 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Sonia Belmont","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Sonia_Belmont"}," on the ",{"t":" Castlevania Wiki","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/"}]}]}],"subs":[]}]}